{"articleNo":"92258","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=92258&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[국제]2013년 제5차 국가영어능력평가시험 1급 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.09.25","hit":"3265","attachments":[{"name":"국가영어시험시행계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=92258&attachNo=73209"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = v ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" /--><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\" stroked=\"f\" filled=\"f\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" o:spt=\"75\" coordsize=\"21600,21600\"><v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:connecttype=\"rect\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:extrusionok=\"f\"></v:path><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:lock aspectratio=\"t\" v:ext=\"edit\"></o:lock></v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"_x76464392\" style=\"WIDTH: 328.51pt; HEIGHT: 328.51pt; v-text-anchor: top\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"><v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:\\DOCUME~1\\user\\LOCALS~1\\Temp\\Hnc\\BinData\\EMB00000844098e.jpg\" o:title=\"EMB00000844098e\"></v:imagedata><!--?xml:namespace prefix = w ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\" /--><w:wrap type=\"square\"></w:wrap></v:shape></p><p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">교육부와 국립국제교육원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">영어 의사소통능력을 향상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">시키고, 취업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">및 승진 등에 활용하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">해외 영어시험(TOEIC 등)에 대한 의존도를 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">낮추고자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">국가영어능력평가시험(1급)을 개발</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">하고 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 20pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">국가영어능력평가시험(1급)은 지식기반 및 국제화 시대에 필요한 비즈니스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">환경에서 필요한 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">실용 영어 능력을 평가하는 시험</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">으로, 다음과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> 같이</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> 2013년 제5차 국가영어능력평가시험 1급을 실시</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">하오니 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 20pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&lt;&lt; 2013년 제5차 국가영어능력평가시험 1급 안내&gt;&gt;</span></p><p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1. 대상 : 18세 이상의 일반인</span></p><p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2. 시험 일시 : </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">‘13. 10. 12(토) 14:00 ~ 17:25</span></p><p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">접수 기간 : </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">‘13. 9. 19(목) ~ 10. 3(목) </span></p><p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">4. 접수 방법 : </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">NEAT 1급 홈페이지(</span><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">www.neat.go.kr</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">) 인터넷 접수</span></p><p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">5. 응시료 : 60,000원</span></p><p class=\"대제목\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">6. 문의사항 : 국립국제교육원 NEAT 1급 팀 (☎02-3668-1470)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/da1cb2a9-a3d7-4de6-875d-3e2d06d6c9a9.jpg\"> \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
